id: pm-xcrlkl
title: CodeFactor fixed-only success payload blocks exact-head release gate
description: "The immutable hosted-analysis release gate accepts only a CodeFactor title of No issues found, but the provider now emits a successful completed check titled 1 issue fixed. with zero annotations after clearing the PR finding. This makes the strict local release gate fail on an otherwise green exact reviewed head."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: "area:ci","area:quality",codefactor,regression,release-gate
