author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "A regression test covers the live successful fixed-only payload and fails before the implementation change.; CodeFactor success is accepted only with completed success, zero annotations, and an explicit no-issues or fixed-only terminal title.; Ambiguous titles, missing/nonzero annotations, pending and failed runs remain fail-closed."
parent: pm-92if
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
environment: PR #829 exact head 408c958f654d300d78cdf93a36d34918684a6c52
repro_steps: "Run pnpm release:gates after CodeFactor completes successfully with output.title=1 issue fixed. and annotations_count=0."
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "The exact-head hosted-analysis gate accepts CodeFactor only when the run is completed and successful, output annotations are exactly zero, and the terminal title explicitly says no issues or fixed-only results."
actual_result: "The validator now accepts the live successful 1 issue fixed. payload only alongside output.annotations_count=0, reports zero outstanding annotations, and retains fail-closed coverage for every ambiguous, missing, nonzero, pending, failed, or malformed state."
affected_version: 2026.7.30
fixed_version: next release after 2026.7.30
regression: true
