  "2026-07-30T12:34:10.800Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: the live fixed-only CodeFactor payload regression first failed 1/56 while all prior cases passed. The implementation now requires completed success, output.annotations_count exactly 0, and an explicit no-issues or numeric fixed-only title. Focused hosted-analysis plus release-runner tests pass 66/66; pnpm lint and pnpm typecheck pass. Live exact-head acceptance passes for 408c958f654d300d78cdf93a36d34918684a6c52 with DeepScan 0 new, CodeFactor title 1 issue fixed., zero outstanding annotations, and strict protected-main requirements."
